{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"448d57fd506ac65ce1b32a581edc9920984633471ee34c28c46c4f1d13445608","ja":"莉緒ちゃん……。\nここにいたのね。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"6de280420accfb574197c10e6b81743de69ac15a2c658ee11433a1e14818b2be","ja":"……ダメね、私って。うまくやろうとすると、\n全然決まらなくって……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"f6780abbc6cfd4509f0535b5bcb713dbc7ba9dc377e3a3057b6911e13e32bef8","ja":"……。ねえ、莉緒ちゃん。私がどうして\n莉緒ちゃんと一緒にお酒を飲むと思う？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"1c76ea930db0270ab6b6ca18340d5edbec94004957d27e468752f0c66be9446b","ja":"え……？　それは、劇場でお酒飲める人は少ないし、\nあとはスケジュールの都合とか……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"d389cac1dd81cb63802511c3577d96c7d06476f5f283a5d74ce3647c984434cf","ja":"それもあるけど……一番の理由は、\n酔った莉緒ちゃんがとっても魅力的だからよ。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"18e3aab0f2c191d2ff4d711511577006d2a1b0425c195c87709f517e673159cd","ja":"魅力的って……。自分で言うのも恥ずかしいけど、\n愚痴っぽくなるし、潰れるまで飲んでるのに……？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"7e41fb0825331d0e82529ea0ee35bf4cd2a18f75701765e9080319e0c618a106","ja":"ええ。気持ちを全力で発散してるんだもの。\n包み隠さない大人の姿、まさしくアダルティよ！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"1f50385dba16533f72e9bde32696e8f6d110f58b3ff34cdd9ede68aeb2830e34","ja":"酔ってる私が……アダルティ……！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"a73c03af1a32d393d566da4500f634580bb93bf3238a4f6b055be74cdaa6e3ca","ja":"アダルティを求める者同士、これからもお酒を酌み交わ\nして、お互い高めあいたい……私はそう思ってるわ。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"b03dbcc2116feb7f93b6189ba4a7196c525eaa4b082f87f0e4d317afe5ebf73b","ja":"……そう、そうよね。私、弱気なこと言ってた。\nアダルティの道を、決して諦めるわけにはいかないわ！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"028328fc15ac75d36c99edc44036c9c940e5c73dc65941c9cfc547387c351b3a","ja":"決まりね！　それじゃあ戻って続きを……って言いたい\nところだけど、もう遅いし私の家で飲みなおしましょ！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"1a6cc1a6ba18b297788b4b07d2259d672cccf369739fcf39933ad052132abf65","ja":"ええ、どこまでもついてくわ！　それじゃあ、\nこのみ姉さんのお家まで、レッツゴー！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"0961085105519248ed949e0deb84b4a0d2797574e2e82d9a668745ae35e23ef0","ja":"あ、待って、莉緒ちゃん！\n私達、まだ衣装のままだから着替えないと……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_830.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"67256e5631595cb95c82f095972ee696fbae78dd4b7a2bb5c78da3bd78e04774","ja":"（ふふ、やっぱりこのノリよね！　一緒に無茶して、\n楽しくお酒を飲んでくれる、私の大切な人……♪）","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
